### Get Student Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/profile/student

### Update Student Profile (multipart with resume)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/profile/student
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fullName"

Jane Doe
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bio"

Computer Science student passionate about web development.
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="skills"
Content-Type: application/json

["JavaScript","React","Node.js"]
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="resume"; filename="resume.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< /path/to/your/resume.pdf
------FormBoundary--

### Get Employer Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/profile/employer

### Update Employer Profile (multipart with logo)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/profile/employer
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="companyName"

Tech Corp Inc.
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="website"

https://techcorp.com
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Leading technology company specializing in web solutions.
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="logo"; filename="logo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< /path/to/your/logo.png
------FormBoundary--